# Engine-mutated runtime state -- tracking these lets any git checkout clobber
# LIVE signals/verdicts with stale committed copies (2026-06-06 incident: a
# checkout reverted strategy_c_plus_live_signal.json from 06-05 to 05-29, and
# stale gate_v2 verdicts would silently mis-authorize trading)
engine/data/gate_v2_verdicts/*.json
engine/strategy_c/output/strategy_c_plus_live_signal.json
engine/strategy_c/output/strategy_c_plus_metrics.json
